#### 成员方法

- **书写规则**：把多个子类中共性的成员方法抽取到父类当中
- **调用规则**：遵循就近原则

```java
package oopextendstests4;

public class Test
{
    static void main()
    {

    }
}

class Fu
{
    public void eat()
    {
        System.out.println('eating');
    }

    public void drink()
    {
        System.out.println('drinking');
    }
}

class Zi1 extends Fu
{
    public void lunch()
    {
        eat();
        drink();
        System.out.println('-----------------------');
        super.eat();
        super.drink();
    }
}
```

